{"slug":"plus-one-digits","title":"Plus One","topic":"arrays-strings","difficulty":"easy","order":111,"tags":["arrays","math","carry"],"timeLimitMs":2000,"concept":{"title":"Adding with a carry, from the right","body":["A number stored as an array of digits is added to from the **right end**, like on paper. Adding 1 to a digit below 9 is the end of the story. A 9 becomes 0 and the carry moves one digit to the left.",{"code":"i = n - 1\nwhile i >= 0 and a[i] == 9:\n    a[i] = 0\n    i -= 1\nif i >= 0:\n    a[i] += 1\nelse:\n    a = [1] + a   # 999 + 1 = 1000"},"Only when every digit was a 9 does the array grow by one place."]},"statement":["A non-negative number is given as `n` digits, the most significant digit first (there are no leading zeros, except for the number 0 itself). Add 1 to the number and print its digits."],"inputFormat":["The first line has `n`.","The second line has the `n` digits separated by spaces."],"outputFormat":["Print the digits of the new number separated by spaces."],"constraints":["1 <= n <= 1000","Each digit is between 0 and 9."],"examples":[{"input":"3\n1 2 9\n","output":"1 3 0\n","note":"129 + 1 = 130."},{"input":"3\n9 9 9\n","output":"1 0 0 0\n","note":"999 + 1 = 1000."}],"hints":["Start at the last digit.","A digit 9 turns into 0 and the carry goes to the next digit on the left.","If you run out of digits, the new number starts with a 1."],"starter":{"python":"n = int(input())\na = list(map(int, input().split()))\n\n# Your code here\n","cpp":"#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n#include <string>\nusing namespace std;\n\nint main() {\n    long long n;\n    cin >> n;\n    vector<long long> a(n);\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) cin >> a[i];\n\n    // Your code here\n\n    return 0;\n}\n","java":"import java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        long n = sc.nextLong();\n        long[] a = new long[(int) n];\n        for (int i = 0; i < a.length; i++) a[i] = sc.nextLong();\n\n        // Your code here\n    }\n}\n"},"solution":{"explanation":["Walk from the last digit. Nines become zeros. The first digit that is not a nine gets +1 and the work is done. If all digits were nines, a leading 1 is added."],"complexity":"Time O(n), space O(1) besides the output.","code":{"python":"n = int(input())\na = list(map(int, input().split()))\n\ni = n - 1\nwhile i >= 0 and a[i] == 9:\n    a[i] = 0\n    i -= 1\nif i >= 0:\n    a[i] += 1\nelse:\n    a = [1] + a\nprint(*a)\n","cpp":"#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n#include <string>\nusing namespace std;\n\nint main() {\n    long long n;\n    cin >> n;\n    vector<long long> a(n);\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) cin >> a[i];\n\n    int i = n - 1;\n    while (i >= 0 && a[i] == 9) {\n        a[i] = 0;\n        i--;\n    }\n    if (i >= 0) a[i]++;\n    else a.insert(a.begin(), 1);\n    for (size_t k = 0; k < a.size(); k++) cout << a[k] << (k + 1 < a.size() ? \" \" : \"\\n\");\n\n    return 0;\n}\n","java":"import java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        long n = sc.nextLong();\n        long[] a = new long[(int) n];\n        for (int i = 0; i < a.length; i++) a[i] = sc.nextLong();\n\n        int i = (int) n - 1;\n        while (i >= 0 && a[i] == 9) {\n            a[i] = 0;\n            i--;\n        }\n        StringBuilder sb = new StringBuilder();\n        if (i >= 0) a[i]++;\n        else sb.append(\"1 \");\n        for (int k = 0; k < a.length; k++) sb.append(a[k]).append(k + 1 < a.length ? \" \" : \"\\n\");\n        System.out.print(sb);\n    }\n}\n"}},"tests":[{"input":"3\n1 2 9\n","output":"1 3 0\n"},{"input":"3\n9 9 9\n","output":"1 0 0 0\n"},{"input":"1\n0\n","output":"1\n"},{"input":"1\n9\n","output":"1 0\n"},{"input":"1\n5\n","output":"6\n"},{"input":"4\n1 9 9 8\n","output":"1 9 9 9\n"},{"input":"5\n8 9 9 9 9\n","output":"9 0 0 0 0\n"},{"input":"12\n9 8 1 4 9 7 4 4 1 5 7 2\n","output":"9 8 1 4 9 7 4 4 1 5 7 3\n"},{"input":"1000\n9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 9 